locker/public/store/kinso
# Kinso's own logo, for Kinso's window (?for=kinso, js/brand.js): theirs, so
# never in this source; a computer that has it keeps it here.
apps/code/native/public/kinso

# Local Kinso reference type (including symlinks) stays out of Git.
apps/code/native/public/fonts/inter-tight.woff2
# Tahlia's desktop for kinso.computer's Mac (website/variant.mjs): Apple's Sonoma aerial S013_C001_F01, a frame at
